From 6d1d1260f37d27f8620193b818cf2db57bfad72b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerege Systems Development Team <dev@gerege.mn>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 09:32:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] feat(platform): wire module registry into server boot and
 expose /v1/platform/modules

- MODULES_DISABLED env (CSV) disables business modules at boot; core or
  unknown ids fail the boot loudly instead of being silently ignored
- module gate middleware mounted on /api after gateway telemetry
- public GET /api/v1/platform/modules returns {id, kind, enabled} for
  frontend nav / mobile / desktop feature flags
- App.Modules() accessor for thin downstream apps
- swagger docs regenerated (also fixes stale platform-core definition
  names left from the repo rename)
